SOAPBOX: iI'm sorry I have missed the filing deadline. two days after the contest is just too short
SOAPBOX:for me. I understand that you have made the deadline so short is to reduce operators xheating
SOAPBOX:on their scores,  However you have just made so that I. my little 100 Watt Wire antenna station
SOAPBOX:can no longer compegte. You see I am age 85. I'm disabled the COPD and Heart Disease.
SOAPBOX:Operating in the contest is extremely tiring for me. It takes me 2-3 days just to recover
SOAPBOX:from a weekend operatating event. Right now I am only responding to an E Mail I received
SOAPBOX: yesterday to provide my log as a check log. I sure wish I could have a little more consideration.
SOAPBOX: I have been a Licensed Ham since I was age 9.(Licensed in 1949) I do love contesting and have
SOAPBOX:been a member of NCCC since 1978. Yours Truly, Bert H. Cook, K6CSL
